Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> program
Rule 1     program -> statement_list
Rule 2     statement_list -> statement_list statement
Rule 3     statement_list -> statement
Rule 4     statement -> declaration
Rule 5     statement -> assignment
Rule 6     statement -> print_statement
Rule 7     statement -> if_statement
Rule 8     statement -> while_statement
Rule 9     declaration -> LET IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON
Rule 10    assignment -> IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expression SEMICOLON
Rule 11    print_statement -> PRINT LEFT_PAREN expression RIGHT_PAREN SEMICOLON
Rule 12    if_statement -> IF LEFT_PAREN expression RIGHT_PAREN block
Rule 13    if_statement -> IF LEFT_PAREN expression RIGHT_PAREN block ELSE block
Rule 14    while_statement -> WHILE LEFT_PAREN expression RIGHT_PAREN block
Rule 15    block -> LEFT_BRACE statement_list RIGHT_BRACE
Rule 16    expression -> expression PLUS expression
Rule 17    expression -> expression MINUS expression
Rule 18    expression -> expression TIMES expression
Rule 19    expression -> expression DIVIDE expression
Rule 20    expression -> expression EQUALS expression
Rule 21    expression -> expression NOT_EQUALS expression
Rule 22    expression -> expression LESS expression
Rule 23    expression -> expression GREATER expression
Rule 24    expression -> expression LESS_OR_EQUAL expression
Rule 25    expression -> expression GREATER_OR_EQUAL expression
Rule 26    expression -> MINUS expression
Rule 27    expression -> LEFT_PAREN expression RIGHT_PAREN
Rule 28    expression -> NUMBER
Rule 29    expression -> IDENTIFIER

